<section class="section pitch">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="kicker">The problem</p>
    <p class="pitch-lede">
      Hand-written E2E tests break every time a selector moves. AI agents that drive the browser
      on <em>every</em> run are slow, non-deterministic, and bill you an LLM call per test.
    </p>
    <p class="pitch-lede accent">
      Windup plans <strong>once</strong> and caches a validated action plan. Replays are
      deterministic and free. When the app changes and a check fails, the plan is invalidated and
      re-planned automatically — self-healing, not silently wrong.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

